Z||000000||SCCA FIERO||09-14-2000||11:30 PM||||I got an e-mail from Ryane with a link to their site  <A HREF="http://www.ryanemotorsports.com/fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ryanemotorsports.com/fiero.htm</A>  and it basically says they are giving up on Fieros/Kitcars to concentrate on other "endeavors". <P>------------------<BR>-Chris <BR>88 Fiero Coupe<BR><B>KEEP THE EXCITEMENT ALIVE!!</B><p>[This message has been edited by SCCA FIERO (edited 09-14-2000).]||||reg||13
